5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin with grace. I believe a balance of logic and patience will guide us to the truth. How do you all intend to find the wolf?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll just observe. Logic is fine, but people often hide behind it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"I'm all about the vibes! I'll trust my intuition and see who feels ""off."" It's more fun that way, right?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Intuition is a start, but we need a systematic approach to eliminate suspects. I prefer focusing on factual inconsistencies.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm gonna find the wolf with my super-detective skills! Hehe, you better be careful, Mr. Wolf!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, intuition has its place, but let us not forget that the wolf is a master of deception. We must seek evidence.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, being too systematic can make you a target. Sometimes the quietest person is the most dangerous.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, that sounds a bit suspicious! But I like your cool style. I'll keep an eye on everyone.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, I agree. We should look for patterns in how people defend themselves or deflect blame.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm not suspicious! I'm just excited! Let's all be best friends until the voting starts!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"A friendly spirit is wonderful, Sakura. However, we must remain vigilant for the sake of the village.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
