31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We wake to a new day. Since no one has died yet, we must rely on our observations from yesterday. Any thoughts?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Everyone seemed normal. Perhaps we should wait for more information before making a hasty accusation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"I don't know... Sakura was acting a bit too hyper, wasn't she? It felt like she was trying too hard.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have a lead. Sakura is the werewolf. I can confirm this with certainty.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"What?! @Jonathan, that's a lie! Why would you say that? I'm just a kid! You're the mean one!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, that is a very bold claim. Are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"It's very convenient to point a finger so early. @Jonathan, are you sure you aren't the wolf trying to frame her?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"Oh, a drama already! I don't know who to believe, but Jonathan seems so sure of himself. It's kind of hot.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am the Seer. I divined Sakura last night. The result was clear: she is the werewolf.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"No way! I'm a villager! Misaki, help me! He's just making things up to look smart!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"If Jonathan is the Seer, the logic is simple: we execute Sakura. But if he is the wolf, we lose a villager.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,Exactly. A fake Seer is a common tactic. We should consider if Jonathan is trying to rush us into a mistake.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,But look at Sakura's face! She's totally panicking. My intuition says Jonathan is telling the truth.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, your attempt to divert attention is noted. The facts remain: Sakura is the wolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not panicking, I'm sad! You're all being mean to me! I'm just a little girl!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,The evidence provided by the Seer is the most reliable tool we have. I believe we should trust Jonathan.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"If you all insist, but I still think this is too fast.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm with Jonathan. Sorry, Sakura, but the vibes are definitely wolfy now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The decision is clear. Let us eliminate the threat.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I hate this game! You're all wrong!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
